<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Heaven’s arches rang when the angels sang,</l><l>Proclaiming Thy royal degree;</l><l>But of lowly birth cam’st Thou, Lord, on earth,</l><l>And in great humility:</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The foxes found rest, and the birds had their nest</l><l>In the shade of the forest tree;</l><l>But Thy couch was the sod, O Thou Son of God,</l><l>In the deserts of Galilee:</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
